# AgentX configuration — copy to .env and edit. (.env is gitignored.)

# Scope the savings report (`npm run report`) to sessions whose working
# directory is at/under this path — e.g. only your billable work sessions.
# Leave unset to include every project under ~/.claude/projects.
AGENTX_REPORT_ROOT=/Users/you/Coding/work

# --- Auto-switch (Phase 4 Path 2) --------------------------------------------
# Read by the Stop hook (bin/nudge.sh). 1 = auto-type `/model <tier>` into the
# live session on a downshift-worthy nudge; DRYRUN=1 logs the command instead.
# These are usually set where the hook is registered (your global
# ~/.claude/settings.json), and are listed here only for reference.
# AGENTX_AUTOSWITCH=0
# AGENTX_AUTOSWITCH_DRYRUN=0

# --- Current-turn prompt router (Phase 4 route hook) -------------------------
# Read by the UserPromptSubmit hook (bin/route.sh). 1 = classify each prompt
# and, on a tier mismatch, block + re-inject `/model <tier>` + the prompt so
# THIS turn runs right-sized. DRYRUN=1 logs the decision instead of injecting.
# AGENTX_ROUTE=0
# AGENTX_ROUTE_DRYRUN=0
#
# Re-injection is blind-timing based (no confirmation the /model switch
# landed before the prompt is re-typed) — inherently racy. If the prompt
# sometimes doesn't come back after a switch, raise these (ms):
# AGENTX_ROUTE_DELAY_MS=500     # wait before typing `/model <tier>`
# AGENTX_ROUTE_DELAY2_MS=900    # wait after that, before re-typing the prompt
#
# Diagnose misses via the timestamped log: $TMPDIR/agentx-autopilot/route.log
